            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "This is the number that settles the sizing question. It snapshots the stored\ncharge the moment the cheap rate ends, so a winter of readings shows whether\nseven hours of Economy 7 actually fills the heater — or whether it needs a\ndaytime top-up, a higher ceiling, or a half-hourly tariff.\n\nWorth revisiting in November, and again after the other two heaters go in."
